```

Example response:

```json
{
  "message": "Agentic CI/CD Gate"
}
```

Health endpoint:

```text
GET /health
```

Example response:

```json
{
  "status": "healthy"
}
```

The application itself is intentionally simple.

The primary focus of this repository is:

> **Agentic CI/CD infrastructure and deployment gating.**

