| OpenTelemetry Operator | Free                         |
| Elastic Cloud          | Free trial                   |
| Docker Hub             | Free tier                    |

> ⚠️ Elastic Cloud usage depends on the active trial or subscription plan. Monitor usage and delete the project after experimentation to avoid unexpected charges.

