↓

Build Docker Image

↓

Push to Docker Hub

↓

Query Live Kubernetes Metrics

↓

Elastic ES|QL

↓

Agent Builder Tool

↓

MCP

↓

GitHub Actions Health Gate

↓

┌─────────────────────┐
│ Is Cluster Healthy? │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
     ┌─────┴─────┐
     │           │
    YES         NO
     │           │
     ▼           ▼
  Deploy      Block
     │
     ▼
Git Commit
     │
     ▼
Argo CD
     │
     ▼
Kubernetes
```

---

# 🎯 Project Summary

**Agentic CI/CD: Kubernetes Deployment Gate with Elastic MCP** demonstrates how modern AI agent infrastructure can be integrated into DevOps workflows.

Instead of treating deployments as purely a code-validation problem, this system incorporates **live runtime infrastructure state** into the deployment decision.

The complete workflow connects:

> **Kubernetes → OpenTelemetry → Elasticsearch → ES|QL → Agent Builder Tool → MCP → GitHub Actions → Git → Argo CD → Kubernetes**

The result is a fully automated, GitOps-based CI/CD pipeline that can **prevent deployments when the target Kubernetes cluster is unhealthy**.

